  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Handhavande Challenge Funds</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Managing Challenge Funds - Travel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att administrera 3 st sk challenge funds;      &quot;Securing water for foor&quot;, &quot;Powering agriculture&quot; and &quot;Global         resilience programme&quot;.Dessa insatser &#xe4;r ovanligt tidskr&#xe4;vande j&#xe4;mf&#xf6;rt med andra insatser att administrera pga sin utformning.Medlen avses   r&#xe4;cka till tre tj&#xe4;nster med resor under 2015-2016.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose is to adminster 3 so-called challenge funds; &quot;Securing    water for foor&quot;, &quot;Powering agriculture&quot; and &quot;Global resilience        programme&quot;. These CFs are unusually time-consuming for Sida to        adminsiter compared to other work due its setup. The contribution     will fund three positions incl travels for 2015-2016.</narrative>
  </description>
